// Tier 3: T.A.R.L. — Policy Enforcement Example
// This example shows how TARL policies protect code execution

// Activate defensive shield
shield on

// Safe variable declaration
drink safeInput = "Hello World"
armored drink protectedValue = 42

// TARL-protected operations
pour "T.A.R.L. policies active"
pour "Input validated: " + safeInput
pour "Protected value: " + protectedValue

shield off
pour "TARL enforcement complete"
